      "text": "# Context Pack: graph anchor release\n\n**Profile:** compact | **Budget:** 14/4000 tokens\n\n## Advisory Memory Banner\n\n**Status:** `degraded`\n\nContext includes 5 degraded signals; semantic embedding is unavailable, so treat retrieval ranking as lexical-only until a semantic model is available.\n\n## artifacts\n\n### 1. mem_00000000000000000000000101 (7 tokens)\n\n```\nGraph anchor memory for release planning.\n```\n\n**Why:** matched 'graph anchor release' via lexical (relevance 1.0000, utility 0.7200)\n\n**Trust:** `agent_validated` / `authoritative`\n\n**Provenance:**\n- `file://docs/query-schema.md#L221` (file)\n\n## procedural_rules\n\n### 2. mem_00000000000000000000000102 (7 tokens)\n\n```\nNeighbor selected only through supports edge.\n```\n\n**Why:** Selected by ee.query.v1 graph hint: seed=mem_00000000000000000000000101, depth=1, traversal=outbound, relation=supports.\n\n**Trust:** `agent_validated` / `authoritative`\n\n**Provenance:**\n- `file://docs/query-schema.md#L230` (file)\n- `ee-mem://mem_00000000000000000000000101` (ee-mem)\n\n## Degradations\n\n- **[warning]** Embedding model unavailable (active embedder source frankensearch_hash_fallback reports semantic=false); semantic similarity is disabled and lexical search remains available.\n  - *Repair:* `ee index reembed --workspace .`\n- **[low]** Memory mem_00000000000000000000000101 evidence freshness is missing_source: Referenced provenance file \\[REDACTED_PATH\\] is missing.\n  - *Repair:* `Restore the file or revise the memory provenance URI; rebuild the index if the memory content changes.`\n- **[low]** 1 graph-neighborhood candidate added to the context candidate pool.\n- **[low]** No persisted graph snapshot exists; query-file traversal used source-of-truth memory_links without centrality boosts.\n  - *Repair:* `ee graph centrality-refresh`\n- **[low]** output.explain was accepted; JSON context packs already include algorithm metadata, the selection audit, and per-item why explanations.\n  - *Repair:* `Inspect data.pack.meta.algorithm, data.pack.selectionAudit, and data.pack.items[].why.`\n\n---\n\n*Generated by `ee pack \"graph anchor release\" --format markdown`*\n\n<!-- pack.hash: normalized-context-pack-hash -->\n<!-- pack.schema: ee.response.v2 -->\n",
